  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "company": "Apple",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "Apple has a trade-in program where customers can return an old iPhone to Apple and receive the trade-in value of the device (the payout) in cash.\n\nFor each store, write a query for the total revenue (payout) from the trade-ins. Order the result in descending order.",
  "notes": [],
